d17192f5446f3a1d5bc6d42a3b997eec5ab906a8583215c", "encounter_hash": "sha256:61304e428b9c35cf40feae3d4f1c946f4fc9fd6941aabef3f98c9f787d703865", "archive_hash": "sha256:9f280293d088cdffa935322a724512dfc869959bf98b7f622d43128393f07b69", "public_replay_hash": "sha256:89e5adae2798f42cb10fff378f89fda07127fe0a131bc46d01389fdeda3447be"}, "retrieval_terms": ["a", "a_tem", "active", "all", "an", "and", "are", "asserted", "b0", "b0111_0001", "be", "behavior", "bit", "bits", "by", "cleared", "clk", "clock", "correctly", "de", "design", "does", "edge", "ensure", "every", "following", "functionality", "i", "if", "implement", "implements", "in", "input", "interface", "into", "is", "least", "left", "like", "logic", "lsb", "match", "matches", "matching", "module", "most", "must", "named", "negative", "not", "of", "on", "one", "operate", "otherwise", "output", "pattern", "perform", "ports", "position", "positive", "previous", "recent", "register", "remain", "reset", "retains", "rst_n", "set", "shift", "shifted", "shifts", "should", "significant", "specific", "specified", "synchronously", "that", "the", "this", "to", "topmodule", "unless", "use", "value", "when", "whenever", "with", "would", "you"], "content": {"validation": "public_pass_single_sample_hidden_unknown", "specification_excerpt": "I would like you to implement a module named `TopModule` with the following interface. All input and output ports are one bit unless otherwise specified.\n\n- **Input ports**:\n  - `clk`\n  - `rst_n`\n  - `a`\n\n- **Output ports**:\n  - `match`\n\nThe module should implement an 8-bit shift register that shifts in the input `a` on every positive edge of the clock. The shift register is named `a_tem` and retains the 8 most recent bits of `a`. The module should perform the following functionality:\n\n1. **Reset Behavior**:\n   - When `rst_n` is de-asserted (logic 0), the shift register `a_tem` should be cleared to `8'b0`, and the output `match` should be set to `0`.\n\n2. **Shift Register Behavior**:\n   - On every positive edge of the clock, if `rst_n` is asserted (logic 1), the input `a` should be shifted into the least significant bit (LSB) of the shift register `a_tem`, and the previous bits should shift left by one position.\n\n3. **Matching Logic**:\n   - The output `match` should be asserted (logic 1) whenever the value of ", "applied_patch": "--- a/rtl/sequence.sv\n+++ b/rtl/sequence.sv\n@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@\n \t\t\tbegin \n \t\t\t\tmatch <= 1'b0;\n \t\t\tend\n-\t\telse if (a_tem == 8'b0111_0000)\n+\t\telse if (a_tem == 8'b0111_0001)\n \t\t\tbegin\n \t\t\t\tmatch <= 1'b1;\n \t\t\tend\n", "public_rows": {"W_bug": "visible_pass", "W_preserve": "visible_pass"}}}}], "state_hash": "sha256:9d4789c3053217fe673b0f4e4b9ee66b3cd02113429c23a004deff6ae4e169c5"}, "losses": [], "gains": [], "incumbent_passed": 0, "candidate_passed": 0, "scheduled_pairs": 4, "incumbent_scores": {"sha256:f8c56ad8df1d5c22e8e6fa95b709f36e698f48c933efe7ba9f708a61b7708185:0": false, "sha256:f8c56ad8df1d5c22e8e6fa95b709f36e698f48c933efe7ba9f708a61b7708185:1": false, "sha256:23471b4b16830f5be400672d2d3e9b3d6e036a47dd5e599c8b8fe13034691dc9:0": false, "sha256:23471b4b16830f5be400672d2d3e9b3d6e036a47dd5e599c8b8fe13034691dc9:1": false}, "candidate_scores": {"sha256:f8c56ad8df1d5c22e8e6fa95b709f36e698f48c933efe7ba9f708a61b7708185:0": false, "sha256:f8c56ad8df1d5c22e8e6fa95b709f36e698f48c933efe7ba9f708a61b7708185:1": false, "sha256:23471b4b16830f5be400672d2d3e9b3d6e036a47dd5e599c8b8fe13034691dc9:0": false, "sha256:23471b4b16830f5be400672d2d3e9b3d6e036a47dd5e599c8b8fe13034691dc9:1": false}, "incumbent_cache_path": "/data2/huangyc/R3E-aic-ic-2026-latest/hard-case-five-round-01/real-all-20261017-064842/Prob001/collection/validation_baseline.json", "incumbent_cache_hash": "sha256:1e604eee46bd7a5899ecd2f9889665008f928a5dab0e23565517209dcf258e8f", "retained_state_hash": "sha256:85e8fbb707b6fca997463be8d6ef1bbf03526260aab6b2abb4db57f9d81f665d", "certificates": [], "retained_entries": 0, "accepted_promotio